{"id":"vod_sn_39068","vodId":"39068","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"一课一练","name_cn":"一课一练","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/10217a00a18e65a46f1376920cd13874.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个学习成绩决定了一切的世界，在这个世界里，在测验里拿到高分的人能够顺理成章的过上无忧无虑的幸福生活，而等待着那些落榜者的，就只是悲惨的惩罚。如此严苛的纪律使得人们自动分为了两派——注重实力，以真材实料取胜的L型，以及依靠着旁门左道的作弊技巧取胜的C型。　　当然，单纯的L型或是C型都无法在日渐激烈的考试竞争中挣得上游，唯有两种类型的人组成搭档，才有可能获得最终的胜利。我们的主人公诸葛睦明（山口智大 配音）就是一个典型的C型选手，一日，他偶遇了非常优秀的L型选手黄巧衣（钉宫理惠 配音），一番波折之后，两人决定组成搭档。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UbxesYuKpQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iUBz4FtqcY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BkcL3ATr9A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TdhBVUYm4Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tyh37Wpe3e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6dJPA19UbH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vENsDNpY3y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x9CrJrn1Su1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ARmRG3hU8m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/30u6C0Ggkd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zVx4U4cpsa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wG2hsBasfM1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.871Z"}